    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have just enough fiendish blood to grant you a tail, but not to the extent that your entire soul and body has shifted to become something like a cazic-fer. You gain a tail, and perhaps even a set of horns. Your tail can perform simple Interact actions, such as opening an unlocked door, and you can’t perform actions with it that requires fingers or significant manual dexterity, including any action that would require a check to accomplish, and you can’t use it to hold items.</span></p>"
